<Base title="Privacy Policy"><div class="prose"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p><em>Last updated: October 15, 2026. Template — have it reviewed before relying on it.</em></p>
<p>This policy describes how PPRGaming ("we") at pprgaming.com handles information.</p>
<h2>Information we collect</h2><ul><li>Information you provide (e.g. email for the newsletter or contact form).</li><li>Automatically collected data such as IP address, browser type and pages visited, via server logs and analytics.</li></ul>
<h2>Cookies and advertising</h2><p>We use, or may use, Google AdSense. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visit to this site and/or other sites on the Internet. You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/">www.aboutads.info</a>. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">how Google uses data from partner sites</a>.</p>
<p>Visitors in the EEA, UK and Switzerland will be shown a consent message (via a Google-certified CMP) before personalized ads are served.</p>
<h2>Affiliate links</h2><p>Some links are affiliate links (e.g. Amazon Associates — "As an Amazon Associate we earn from qualifying purchases"). Retailers may set cookies to attribute purchases.</p>
<h2>Newsletter</h2><p>Emails are stored with our newsletter provider and used only to send the newsletter. Unsubscribe any time.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2><p>Depending on where you live (e.g. GDPR, CCPA/CPRA), you may request access to or deletion of your data. Contact <a href="mailto:contact@pprgaming.com">contact@pprgaming.com</a>.</p>
<h2>Children</h2><p>This site is not directed to children under 13.</p>
</div></Base>
